      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can confirm, seeing lots of 60K+ avatars on Quest, but still seeing the Quest version. I think Performance Rating is looking at PC stats on Quest, so if they aren't the same on both platforms it's blocked right now. Haven't tested enough to know for sure yet.\n\nUpdate: I tested against today and can't make it happen. Don't think there was an update. Maybe it was just a ghost, or something they fixed in the API server-side for the Quest app.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
